<title>USA: U.S. cash DAP, ammonia prices unchanged.</title>
<headline>U.S. cash DAP, ammonia prices unchanged.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-02-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>U.S. cash diammonium phosphate (DAP) values and ammonia prices were mostly unchanged in light dealings, cash dealers said. Shipping problems on the Illinois River have not yet affected fertilizer shipments, which should pick up later this spring.</p>
<p>			    Dlrs/short ton	 Chg from Wednesday</p>
<p>DAP central Fla	  174-176			  unc</p>
<p>DAP central La Gulf    185-187			  unc</p>
<p>Ammonia/La Gulf		220			  unc</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk 312-408-8720))</p>
</text>
